","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nWorks in 4.6.3\nBug occurs in Godot v4.7.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8134) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13420H (12 threads) - 15.70 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm using set_axis_velocity() to fire Nerf Darts from a Player Node. The Nerf Darts are RigidBody2D nodes, The Nerf Darts are supposed to bounce when hitting another RigidBody2D so I use set_axis_velocity() to sent them flying.\nThis works well in 4.6.3, but after I converted my project with 4.7 this stopped working. Instead of moving after spawning the Nerf Darts just stayed where they where spawned.\nOkay, the may wiggle a bit, and sometimes they even start moving.\nSee player.dg for spawning and nerf_dart.gd for setting the axis\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCheck project with 4.6.3: Run, click next to the central icon to fire a nerf_dart towards the mouse pointer. nerf_dart flies away, everything is fine.\nOpen with 4.7. Retry. nerf_darts are spawned but don't move. Sometimes they start moving after a second. \n\n<img width=\"932\" height=\"593\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/040c4e0b-899d-4824-8352-8bbedfada5a3\" />\n\nIn nerf_dart.gd, line 11 & 12, use apply_central_impulse() instead of set_axis_velocity(), then try again:\n\t# set_axis_velocity(force)\n\tapply_central_impulse(force)\n\nBehaviour does not change.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis is a project created with 4.6.3 to demonstrate the working code before migration to 4.7.\nConvert it for comparison.\n\n[force-error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29740612/force-error.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121038/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121038/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}